OL,4,G2100FThe Reith Lectures
OL,5,     GIn this fourth and final lecture,
OL,6,     GRutger Bregman warns of the
OL,7,     Gexistential risks posed by
OL,8,     Gunchecked tech and AI. He urges
OL,9,     Gprivileged individuals to do
OL,10,     Gbetter in shaping our future.
OL,11,G2200FThe World Tonight
OL,12,G2245FMary Macdonald's Big Trip by
OL,13,     FAlexander McCall Smith
OL,14,     GIn Alexander McCall Smith's new
OL,15,     Gserial for radio, Miss Macdonald
OL,16,     Glearns an important lesson about
OL,17,     Gkarma amidst the beauty and
OL,18,     Gbustle of Kathmandu. Read by Ceit
OL,19,     GKearney.
